WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,120 --> 00:00:04,520
Xiaoman wake up

2
00:00:08,150 --> 00:00:16,300
Sister Liu, what is that? Just tap your head a few times.

3
00:00:16,460 --> 00:00:18,180
At present, I only have one head and is not very big.

4
00:00:18,980 --> 00:00:37,230
Sister, are there enough torches? Don’t be born and run away.

5
00:00:37,630 --> 00:00:38,910
Blue Metabar

6
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:46,120
They're all here, not a single one is missing

7
00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:50,400
The big one didn't move.

8
00:00:51,210 --> 00:00:52,290
Double the number of hands

9
00:00:52,610 --> 00:00:55,370
No matter how much you add, it won't stop the big one, so what should you do?

10
00:00:55,650 --> 00:01:00,130
When they come in groups one day, we can't wait for the condoms to be put up first.

11
00:01:00,410 --> 00:01:02,690
Prepare fire, knife and rope together

12
00:01:03,460 --> 00:01:14,870
There are four people signing up for the homestay tomorrow. I, I, will go too.

13
00:01:17,050 --> 00:01:18,770
Your third line of fire control in Pokou City

14
00:01:18,930 --> 00:01:20,530
The rope end is always wrong

15
00:01:21,180 --> 00:01:22,980
When did you see me passing by?

16
00:01:23,780 --> 00:01:25,100
I'm going to change the rope tomorrow.

17
00:01:25,620 --> 00:01:26,980
My stone fire is not finished yet

18
00:01:27,300 --> 00:01:28,260
Stone will work another day

19
00:01:28,700 --> 00:01:33,410
He wants to change your belief first. He also wants to be angry.
